  "liner": {
   "body_md": "## Setlist highlights\n\n- **Most Of What I Like**: rare: 10 archived performances [4]\n- **Aerodynamic**: rare: 10 archived performances [4]\n- **The Silver Cord**: rare: 13 archived performances [4]\n\n## The recordings\n\n- **kglw2025-08-17.mk21.flac24** (recommended): source not stated; 19 songs; 177 min [1]\n- **kglw2025-08-17.birds**: source not stated; 19 songs; 176 min [2]\n- **kglw2025-08-17**: source not stated; 19 songs; 176 min [3]\n\n## Around the show\n\n- Microphones positioned stage left, eight feet up from SBD edge [2]\n- Mics placed 8.5 feet high, 12 feet left of SBD, 150 feet from stage [3]\n\n## Tapers and lineage\n\n- **kglw2025-08-17.mk21.flac24**: taped by Brian Porter; source: Schoeps mk21 (ORTF wide) > kcy > Sonosax SX-M2/LS2 > Sony M10 (24/96) [1]\n- **kglw2025-08-17.birds**: taped by Birds; transferred by Birds; source: x2 Rode NT5 > H6 Handy Recorder [2]\n- **kglw2025-08-17**: taped by puffanug; transferred by puffanug; source: ADK Thor > PMD661 > 24/96 wav [3]. Also: ADK Thor in ORTF recorded to PMD661 with Oade concert mod [3]",
